	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi tuas, chare frater, literas, ex quibus i<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ntellexi primum quidem te maximopere scire desi<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>derare, quid scripserit d. <persName ref="p8075">Erastus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ergo literas eius <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>hic mitto, sed ut remittas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nihil huius intellexi, licet <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tuas ei inscriptas diligenter curaverim ei tradi <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ac traditas sciam, neque a <persName ref="p1227">Froschouero</persName> audivi quicquam, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nec mirum, cum <persName ref="p8075">Erastus</persName> non fuerit <placeName ref="l157">Franckfordiae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Praestaret forte duo colligata mittere exemplaria, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>alterum pro principe, alterum pro <persName ref="p8075">Erasto</persName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quodsi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>alia et priora quidem illa tua exempla ipsi sunt <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>antea reddita, donabit his duobus posterioribus tuis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>alios viros bonos etc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Deinde describis mihi mortem <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>reverendi episcopi, cuius vices doleo, idque ex animo, non <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>tam, quod metuam pessimum ei successurum, quam quod eo fructu <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>spoliati sumus, qui ex hoc sperabatur; <foreign xml:lang="de">aber wir sind <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>filicht bessers nitt wärt.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Noli autem cogitare rem eo de<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ducendam, ut nullus amplius sit episcopus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ego quidem optarem <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nullum; sed multae sunt rationes, cur putem id impossibile.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Laborandum interim puto pro eo, quod bonum est, et eventus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>domino committendus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">- <placeName ref="l37">Bregalienses</placeName><note type="misc">von Fabr. übergeschr./korrig.: "rätigavisenses".</note> excitati exemplo <placeName ref="l638">Enga<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>dinorum</placeName> faciunt, quod faciunt; nam a domino est, ut pension<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>arii sentiant iudicium dei et cogitent, quid agant, ne <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>aliquando graviora experiantur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">- Quae de foedere pontificio <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>scripsisti, communicavi cum utroque consule.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Vehementissime <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>displicuit eis; specta[n]t enim illa ad <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiae</placeName> interitum, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nec dubito, quin ea de re diligenter sint <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>cogitaturi et consultaturi.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dominus infringat consilia <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>truculenta et convertat in capita authorum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Com<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>mode se hodie offert, qui <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> abit et redit.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Praestaret d. legatum suggerere passim amicis suis, q<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>uae existimat consilio <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>huic pernitioso opponenda etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Es ist übel zuͦ besorgen, das gälltnemmen werde <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>uns dahin bringen, dahin wir hörend, diewyl so <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>langwirige warnung und das vilfalltig predigen <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>in wynd fräffenlich geschlagen wirt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Gott <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>erbarme sich unser.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><placeName>Angu[i]sola</placeName> comes hic fuit <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>per aliquot dies.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Cum huc venisset, dixit se mansurum <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>hic in tam amoeno loco longo tempore.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quid autem senseri<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>t aut qualia responsa acceperit, nescio.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Hoc scio: <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>illum protinus mutato consilio reces isse, nec venit <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>in senatum neque quicquam scripto proposuit; cum enim <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>consules ad eius postulatum publica comitia conscribere nollent, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/><foreign xml:lang="de">hat er gesähen, das er wenig schaffen etc.</foreign></s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta amplissimum <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>virum d. legatum, d. consules et amicos nostros.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 11. maii 1565.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fideli ministro, domino et <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fratri meo colendo et di<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>lectissimo.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Chur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
